Senter syndrome,"Senter syndrome is a cutaneous condition characterized by similar skin changes and congenital hearing impairment to keratitisichthyosisdeafness syndrome, but is associated with glycogen storage leading to hepatomegaly, hepatic cirrhosis, growth failure and intellectual disability.

