Acne miliaris necrotica,"Acne miliaris necrotica is a rare condition consisting of follicular vesicopustules, sometimes occurring as solitary lesions that are usually very itchy.  The condition affects middle aged and elderly individuals.  Affected areas can include the scalp, frontal hairline, face, and chest.

