Ju, Yo-El; Schwedt, Todd (29 March 2010). ""Abrupt-Onset Severe Headaches"". Seminars in Neurology. 30 (2): 192200. doi:10.1055/s-0030-1249229. PMC 3558726. PMID 20352589.
